# `**/target/` and not just `target/`: the vendored `playwright-rs` crate builds its own
# `vendor/playwright-rs/target/` (~650 MB), and a root-anchored `target/` does not match it — so a
# contributor who had already built the vendor shipped all of it into the build context.
target/
**/target/
.git/
*.md
tests/
.dockerignore
